theme/debian-breeze-authelia-passkey-patch/ contains unified diffs against
sddm-theme-debian-breeze (KDE plasma-desktop, GPL-2.0-or-later/LGPL, mixed
per-file). No theme source is vendored here; the patch files themselves are
MIT per above, but applying them to your own installed theme produces a
GPL-covered combined file, which remains subject to that license. See
theme/debian-breeze-authelia-passkey-patch/README.md.
